# Google Apps Script Web App URL
# 1. Buka Google Apps Script (script.google.com)
# 2. Buat project baru dan paste kode dari folder `gas/Code.gs`
# 3. Klik "Deploy" -> "New deployment"
# 4. Pilih type "Web app"
# 5. Set "Execute as" ke "Me" dan "Who has access" ke "Anyone"
# 6. Copy URL Web app yang dihasilkan dan paste di bawah ini:
VITE_GAS_WEB_APP_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzTyGL1nfoO6eU6ombC3J-GF6-jM_ElGUd8vE-iwNW6kiR7wp327aUNWSwKltWzDfS_hA/exec
